I just downloaded and successfully de-archived this NetHack version
with Stuffit Expander 10.0.1.

According to Stuffit (Allume) support, error 17537 implies a corrupted
or damaged archive file.

My suggestions, in this order:

* If you are using Stuffit version 10.0.0, upgrade to 10.0.1.
* In your Stuffit preferences, disable "Continue to expand if possible."
* Try different NetHack download mirrors, including the FTP mirrors.
* Reinstall Stuffit.

Also, if you have both OS X and Classic versions of Stuffit installed,
you may be inadvertently running the Classic version via double-click;
if that's the case, remove the Classic version.

